WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.472
It was a beautiful day.

2
00:00:03.473 --> 00:00:06.353
Oliver was on his tablet.

3
00:00:06.354 --> 00:00:09.395
"It's nice out," Mom said.

4
00:00:09.396 --> 00:00:11.924
"You should go outside."

5
00:00:11.925 --> 00:00:15.211
Oliver stared at the screen.

6
00:00:15.212 --> 00:00:19.521
"Nah. I'm watching cartoons."

7
00:00:19.522 --> 00:00:23.836
Mom sighed.

8
00:00:23.837 --> 00:00:27.858
Harry walked in and flopped onto the couch.

9
00:00:27.859 --> 00:00:31.233
He was on his phone.

10
00:00:31.234 --> 00:00:34.201
"Harry," Mom said.

11
00:00:34.202 --> 00:00:37.846
"You and Oliver should go outside."

12
00:00:37.847 --> 00:00:40.877
Harry stared at his phone. "Huh?"

13
00:00:40.878 --> 00:00:46.583
Mom groaned. "No more video games, Harry."

14
00:00:46.584 --> 00:00:49.817
Harry kept looking at his phone.

15
00:00:49.818 --> 00:00:50.622
"In a minute.

16
00:00:50.623 --> 00:00:53.084
I have to beat this level."

17
00:00:53.085 --> 00:00:55.772
Emmy walked into the room.

18
00:00:55.773 --> 00:01:00.342
She was staring down at her phone.

19
00:01:00.343 --> 00:01:04.545
Bam! Emmy walked right into Mom.

20
00:01:04.546 --> 00:01:08.536
"Don't text while walking," Mom said.

21
00:01:08.537 --> 00:01:12.438
Emmy didn't even look up. "Huh?"

22
00:01:12.439 --> 00:01:18.454
Then she laughed at something on her phone.

23
00:01:18.455 --> 00:01:21.165
"That's it," Mom said.

24
00:01:21.166 --> 00:01:24.387
"No more screen time!"

25
00:01:24.388 --> 00:01:30.557
Oliver looked up. "There's nothing else to do."

26
00:01:30.558 --> 00:01:38.357
Mom folded her arms. "Go outside. Now."

27
00:01:37.207 --> 00:01:40.347
"Ugh!" Emmy said.

28
00:01:40.348 --> 00:01:43.834
The kids put down their devices.

29
00:01:43.835 --> 00:01:48.228
They went outside.

30
00:01:48.229 --> 00:01:54.632
Then they sat and complained.

31
00:01:54.633 --> 00:01:59.341
Finally Harry got a ball.

32
00:01:59.342 --> 00:02:04.009
Soon they were having fun.

33
00:02:04.010 --> 00:02:07.284
The ball landed near the window.

34
00:02:07.285 --> 00:02:10.798
Oliver got it.

35
00:02:10.799 --> 00:02:14.221
He saw Mom on her phone!

36
00:02:14.222 --> 00:02:18.492
"No fair!" Oliver said.

37
00:02:18.493 --> 00:02:21.859
Mom grinned. "Sorry."

38
00:02:21.860 --> 00:02:24.297
She put down her phone.

39
00:02:24.298 --> 00:02:27.720
She went outside.

40
00:02:27.721 --> 00:02:36.618
"Let's play!" Mom said.

